<!--
  ThemeMode="System"：使用 .NET 9 起 WPF 内置的 Fluent 主题（Windows 11 风格，含浅色/
  深色两套配色与系统强调色），并让整个应用跟随 Windows 当前的浅色/深色模式设置自动切换
  （对应 Windows 设置 -> 个性化 -> 颜色 -> 选择你的模式）。这是声明式（XAML 特性）用法，
  不涉及在代码里访问 ThemeMode 属性，因此不需要 <NoWarn>WPF0001</NoWarn>（该警告只在
  C# 代码里读写 ThemeMode 属性时才会触发）。
  详见 https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/desktop/wpf/whats-new/net90#thememode

  ThemeMode="System": uses WPF's built-in Fluent theme (available since .NET 9; Windows 11
  styling with light/dark palettes and system accent color support), and makes the whole
  app automatically follow Windows' current light/dark mode setting (Settings -> Personalization
  -> Colors -> Choose your mode). This is the declarative (XAML attribute) usage, which does
  not access the ThemeMode property from code, so it does not require suppressing WPF0001
  (that warning only fires when reading/writing ThemeMode from C# code).
  See https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/desktop/wpf/whats-new/net90#thememode
-->
<Application x:Class="SevenZipLite.WpfDemo.App"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             StartupUri="MainWindow.xaml"
             ThemeMode="System">
    <Application.Resources />
</Application>
